      "jcr:created": "Tue Dec 01 2020 18:42:37 GMT+0000",
      "gradientDirection": "left-to-right",
      "line2": "<p style=\"text-align: left;\"><span class=\"fontsize-1-5-vw\">As a surgeon, you need to do life-changing work—and keep yourself safe at the same time. We have your back.</span></p>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: left;\"><span class=\"fontsize-1-5-vw\">Together, T7 and T7plus create a personal protection system that’s tailored to your fit, keeping you comfortable and cool, in any surgical procedure.</span></p>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: left;\"><span class=\"fontsize-1-5-vw\">Here at Stryker, your opinion and feedback guide our work. This means we designed this system to fit your needs so you can step into any situation in the OR with complete confidence in your personal comfort and protection.</span></p>\r\n",
      "jcr:lastModified": "Tue Dec 01 2020 18:45:35 GMT+0000",
